{
  "id": "c1-e38-home-and-belonging",
  "level": "C1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Home and belonging",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good evening. First of all, we'd like to know a little about you.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e38-home-and-belonging/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, what does the word home mean to you?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e38-home-and-belonging/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3700
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, do you feel you belong to the place where you grew up?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e38-home-and-belonging/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4400
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, how easy do you find it to settle in a new place?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e38-home-and-belonging/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4500
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, have you ever felt like an outsider?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e38-home-and-belonging/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3800
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e38-home-and-belonging/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e38-a1",
            "c1-e38-a2",
            "c1-e38-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show people in places that may or may not feel like home. Choose two of the pictures and say what the people might be feeling, and what might help them to feel at home.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e38-home-and-belonging/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12700
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, which of these situations do you think is the most difficult?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e38-home-and-belonging/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5600
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e38-b1",
            "c1-e38-b2",
            "c1-e38-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show people and their relationship to a place. Choose two of the pictures and say what makes people feel they belong, and what could make them feel excluded.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e38-home-and-belonging/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, what helps people to feel they belong?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e38-home-and-belonging/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 3900
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some things that help people feel at home in a place, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e38-home-and-belonging/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10400
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e38-home-and-belonging",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How might these things help someone feel they belong in a new place?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e38-home-and-belonging/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7300
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e38-home-and-belonging",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which is the most important?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e38-home-and-belonging/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5400
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about home and belonging.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e38-home-and-belonging/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4900
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "To what extent is a sense of belonging linked to a particular place?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e38-home-and-belonging/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4800
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think people who move often can ever feel truly at home?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e38-home-and-belonging/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5600
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, how should communities treat newcomers who have a very different way of life?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e38-home-and-belonging/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Can technology help people feel close to home when they live far away?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e38-home-and-belonging/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, is national identity becoming less important?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e38-home-and-belonging/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5100
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, why might some people feel nostalgic for a place that has changed?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e38-home-and-belonging/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
